  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Health Security (GHS) Project - Support to Key ECTAD Staff in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the GHS (2021-2024) is to reduce the risk and impact of emerging and endemic infectious zoonotic diseases as well as AMR threats in Egypt. The program in Egypt aims to enhance the prevention, detection and response capacity of the animal health system by anchoring itself on five national and global priorities, which are considered as main drivers of the program.</narrative>
  </description>
